                "entry_id": "ee3b8d63-4ae8-3fb9-96c3-d5447d7fb671",
                "word": "nationalitaire",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "65344d14-59bd-4b13-95a1-86be1676e7fa",
                        "entry_id": "ee3b8d63-4ae8-3fb9-96c3-d5447d7fb671",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "nationalitaires"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82106be1-539e-3354-b821-98ba7cf2478b",
                        "entry_id": "ee3b8d63-4ae8-3fb9-96c3-d5447d7fb671",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui relève du nationalitarisme ; qui exprime une revendication nationaliste différente de celle, majoritaire, de l’État-nation ou de celle, morcelée, d’un État multinational."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1028cdb7-26ac-4e80-b566-4dbfb8877de1",
                                "sense_id": "82106be1-539e-3354-b821-98ba7cf2478b",
                                "text": "La morale des philosophes grecs, on l'a dit, est nationalitaire ; leur métaphysique est universelle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "323d2e42-378c-4cb3-a5cf-281e4d2313b2",
                                "sense_id": "82106be1-539e-3354-b821-98ba7cf2478b",
                                "text": "Certains États réputés plus stables et de toute manière plus riches sont travaillés par des conflits de type nationalitaire ou communautaire avec pour enjeu le maintien de leur unité et le partage des richesses, comme l'Espagne, affrontant le nationalisme basque, l'Italie où la Ligue du Nord agite la sécession pour se séparer du Mezzogiorno réputé improductif et corrompu, la Belgique qui vit la tension des flamands et des wallons."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4c3812c-b60d-48ce-83bf-a2c2fe746772",
                                "sense_id": "82106be1-539e-3354-b821-98ba7cf2478b",
                                "text": "Dans cette étude biographique, nous analysons, à partir du promoteur d’une entreprise nationalitaire, la mobilisation de multiples ressources pour la définition, la défense et la promotion d’une hypothétique identité flamande dans le nord de la France."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e07b83d0-ca48-4fa1-bece-371d045bcce4",
                        "source_entry_id": "ee3b8d63-4ae8-3fb9-96c3-d5447d7fb671",
                        "source_sense_id": "82106be1-539e-3354-b821-98ba7cf2478b",
                        "source_sense_description": "relatif au nationalitarisme",
                        "target_lang_word": "nationalitarian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nationalitarian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3508ca97-4f11-3ecf-8875-9c14e21f01c2",
                                        "entry_id": "ff1878f8-d01b-3f33-968f-af826b1273db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Supporting an inclusive concept of nationhood that embraces all members of a society and not just a dominant elite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d790ff6a-64ab-4f20-8c22-fd47751c0959",
                                                "sense_id": "3508ca97-4f11-3ecf-8875-9c14e21f01c2",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, the nationalitarian phenomenon is one in which the struggle against the imperialist powers of occupation has as its object, beyond the clearing of the national territory, the independence and sovereignty of the national State, uprooting in depth the positions of the ex-colonial power— the reconquest of the power of decision in all domains of national life, the prelude to that reconquest of identity which is at the heart of the renaissance undertaken on the basis of fundamental national demands, and ceaselessly contested, by every means available, on every level, and notably on the internal level'."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f10b371-3137-4b96-b0fe-0d2cd2fd0302",
                                                "sense_id": "3508ca97-4f11-3ecf-8875-9c14e21f01c2",
                                                "text": "And the birth of nations implies many artifices: Not only are they constituted in an active struggle against the imperial or evolved systems, the feudal systems, and the autonomous cities, but they crush their own \"minorities,\" in other words, minoritarian phenomena that could be termed \"nationalitarian,\" which work from within and if need be turn to the old codes to find a greater degree of freedom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8bf12ac-3d20-40e2-93ef-c42eeeafb022",
                                                "sense_id": "3508ca97-4f11-3ecf-8875-9c14e21f01c2",
                                                "text": "Van Gennep is adamant that the nationalitarian sentiment precedes modernity, and he quotes a variety of cases in which the existence of such sentiment can be reasonably assumed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2c244649-9c8b-46a4-bc6f-751e36aec9db",
                        "source_entry_id": "ee3b8d63-4ae8-3fb9-96c3-d5447d7fb671",
                        "source_sense_id": "82106be1-539e-3354-b821-98ba7cf2478b",
